#. module: sale_tiktok
#: model:ir.module.module,description:base.module_sale_tiktok
msgid ""
"\n"
"Import your TikTok Shop orders in Odoo and synchronize deliveries\n"
"=================================================================\n"
"\n"
"Key Features\n"
"------------\n"
"* Import orders from multiple shops\n"
"* Orders are matched with Odoo products based on their internal reference\n"
"  (SKU in TikTok Shop)\n"
"* Support for Fulfillment by Seller (FBS)\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"ນຳເຂົ້າຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ TikTok Shop ຂອງທ່ານເຂົ້າໃນ Odoo ແລະ ຊິ້ງຄ໌ການຈັດສົ່ງ\n"
"=================================================================\n"
"\n"
"ຄຸນສົມບັດຫຼັກ\n"
"------------\n"
"* ນຳເຂົ້າຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຈາກຫຼາຍຮ້ານຄ້າ\n"
"* ຄຳສັ່ງຊື້ຈະຖືກຈັບຄູ່ກັບສິນຄ້າໃນ Odoo ໂດຍອີງຕາມລະຫັດອ້າງອີງພາຍໃນ\n"
"  (SKU ໃນ TikTok Shop)\n"
"* ຮອງຮັບການຈັດການສິນຄ້າໂດຍຜູ້ຂາຍ (FBS)\n"

#. module: sale_tiktok
